From f274ec3362dc6bf16e1b2028454b472b73f81554 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d012 setup <setup@localhost>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:45:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Texture pack: decode the bundle on the CPU when the GPU
 cannot sample BC7

The shipped pack is only hd.bundle (BC7), with no PNGs beside it. On a GPU without BC7 (most phones) the bundle was switched off,
so the game showed the original textures. It now decodes each image's first level to RGBA8 (host/gpu/bc7_decode.hpp: modes 1 and 6,
which the pack's encoder writes, and modes 3, 4, 5 and 7) and loads it like a PNG, mip chain included.
---
